Carol, what did you do for your third grade science project?

35
00:02:15,880 --> 00:02:19,820
Well, I constructed a compound of monodichlorides and polydichlorides that were

36
00:02:19,820 --> 00:02:22,740
capable of withstanding excessive heat and mechanical stress.

37
00:02:26,860 --> 00:02:30,960
Mike? I ran tests to see how high a super ball would bounce.

38
00:02:34,800 --> 00:02:37,700
Well at least we've now defined the boundaries of science.

39
00:02:38,840 --> 00:02:40,500
Morning everybody. Hi.

40
00:02:40,500 --> 00:02:41,360
You look nice.

41
00:02:41,380 --> 00:02:43,340
Thanks. Wow, you sure do.

42
00:02:44,340 --> 00:02:45,100
