44
00:02:49,340 --> 00:02:53,340
Do you realize that they are just dumping this stuff all over Long Island?

45
00:02:53,860 --> 00:02:55,080
May very well be in our water.

46
00:02:55,400 --> 00:02:56,420
Even our food.

47
00:02:56,800 --> 00:02:58,020
Even in our eggs.

48
00:02:59,260 --> 00:03:00,320
We're gonna be late.

49
00:03:01,380 --> 00:03:02,780
Bye, everybody. Bye.

50
00:03:03,400 --> 00:03:05,140
Bye -bye. See you at lunch.

51
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:09,420
Lunch? Yeah, you're gonna meet me back here for lunch.

52
