Oh, Jason, I'm sorry.

53
00:03:13,020 --> 00:03:14,520
I completely forgot.

54
00:03:15,060 --> 00:03:17,580
No problem. So, we'll see you about noon?

55
00:03:18,220 --> 00:03:20,660
Well, the problem is I don't think I'll have time to come home.

56
00:03:21,320 --> 00:03:23,060
It's your cooking, Dad.

57
00:03:23,160 --> 00:03:24,240
Take her out.

58
00:03:25,700 --> 00:03:30,340
Good idea. Look, why don't I just come by there and I'll take you out for lunch?

59
00:03:30,700 --> 00:03:32,860
Oh, gee, I'm not sure what time I'll be free.

60
00:03:32,980 --> 00:03:34,620
Oh, Jason, I don't want you to have to wait around.

61
00:03:34,680 --> 00:03:35,580
Oh, that's no problem.

62
00:03:35,640 --> 00:03:36,540
It'll be fun for me.

63
